# PARKED — NOT APPLIED TO V1. V1 is frozen as the measurement baseline.
#
# Refuses approval of a plan holding a concept that belongs to no module
# (and the mirror: a module naming a concept absent from scope). Written
# against the pre-restructure layout, so paths are agent/... not V1/agent/...
# Apply with:  git apply --directory=V1 v1-orphan-approval-gate.patch
#
# The harness MEASURES this defect instead (observe.partition -> orphans,
# phantoms). Applying this changes V1's behaviour and invalidates the
# baseline hash in harness/baseline.py.
#
